Usage:
------

quartus_sta [-h | --help[=<option|topic>] | -v]
quartus_sta <project name> [<options>]
quartus_sta -t <script file> [<script args>]
quartus_sta -s
quartus_sta --tcl_eval <tcl command>

Description:
------------


